{"text":"熙平二年五月廿四日，比丘惠珍仰爲父母眷屬及以己身敬造釋迦像一區并七佛。願所願隨。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"惠珍","refId":null,"text":"惠珍","start":12,"end":14},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"釋迦","refId":null,"text":"釋迦","start":26,"end":28},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"七佛","refId":null,"text":"七佛","start":32,"end":34}]}